# Product statuses (locked spec)

- **Published** = live on MM.
- **Unpublish** = complete, not live.
- **Draft** = incomplete, not live. Publish is allowed after listing missing MOQ/lead.
- **Soft delete** = never live. Restore first (becomes Draft or Unpublish). `publishAdminProduct` must return `{ error: "deleted" }`.

Hard block Publish: official SKU, name, unit, category, duplicate SKU. Warn only: MOQ, lead.

```jsx
// ❌ BAD
publishAdminProduct(softDeleted.id);

// ✅ GOOD
<button disabled={product.deleted} onClick={() => requestPublish(product)}>Publish</button>
<button onClick={() => restoreAdminProduct(product.id)}>Restore</button>
```
